      "1": {
        "title": "Nutti Squirrel and the Secret of Nuts",
        "text": "Once upon a time, there was a lively squirrel named Nutti who lived in a big oak tree. Nutti was different from other squirrels - he loved mathematics!"
      },
      "2": {
        "title": "Preparing for Winter",
        "text": "Autumn was coming, and Nutti knew he had to collect nuts for the winter. But how many nuts would he actually need?"
      },
      "3": {
        "title": "The Power of Multiplication Tables",
        "text": "Nutti remembered that his grandmother had taught him multiplication tables. 'If you collect 7 nuts a day for 8 days, how many do you have in total?' grandmother had asked."
      },
      "4": {
        "title": "The Adventure Begins",
        "text": "Nutti decided he would learn all multiplication tables perfectly. That way, he could quickly calculate how many nuts he had at any time!"
      },
      "5": {
        "title": "Join Nutti's Adventure!",
        "text": "Now you can help Nutti learn multiplication tables! Every correct answer helps Nutti collect nuts for the winter. Are you ready?"
